      "writtenOn": "2024-12-11T16:19:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the hvc returns ENOMEM we exit the loop.\n\nI would like to keep it simple and `share` a single page with the hypervisor even though this would require more back and forth through the hvc. Here you can see that I am advancing the range of the walk by looking at the last address from the buffer.",
