      "message": "Sorry, I\u0027m not sure to follow. here if write_index is negative, you just exit the show right?\n\nAlso if you do the dump in several HVCs, that means the dump is not atomic and the dump can be inconsistent.",
      "parentUuid": "455e3e7d_0f600dc0",
